# /architect only when asked

Run `/architect` (pstack: ground, then arena at least two structurally distinct sketches internally, then implement the synthesized sketch) **only when the brief explicitly says `/architect`**.

Small diffs and routine fixes skip it. Do not treat every product change as an architect job.

When `/architect` is requested: stay in one cloud-agent thread, run the arena internally, do not spawn extra cloud agents. Use `.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc` for the role map.
